      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>With good luck.</li>\n<li>Record //of testimony// which took place before us&mdash;we, the</li>\n<li>undersigned witnesses, on Thursday</li>\n<li>the twenty-fourth day</li>\n<li>of the month of Tammuz of the year one thousand two hundred</li>\n<li>and ninety-eight years of the count</li>\n<li>(of the Era) of Documents, which we regularly employ</li>\n<li>in Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d Egypt,</li>\n<li>situated on the great Nile River</li>\n<li>//and four// Thus: Joseph b. Jacob</li>\n<li>and &lsquo;Al\u012b b. Q\u012bmo\u012b said to us: &ldquo;Be</li>\n<li>witnesses on our behalf, perform a qinyan with us</li>\n<li>effective immediately, write and sign</li>\n<li>on our behalf, using all the language of claims,</li>\n<li>that we have collaborated (in a partnership), placing</li>\n<li>in a (single) purse four silver coins,</li>\n<li>from which each of us (contributed)</li>\n<li>two silver coins. Both of them</li>\n<li>will buy and sell,</li>\n<li>purchase and transact</li>\n<li>with them in whatever sort</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
